I have tested on windows and linux , only windows and use php extension intl will cause this problem.
1.make a model Test.php

<pre>namespace app\models;
use yii\base\Model;
class Test extends Model{
    public $birthday;
    public function rules(){
        return [
            ['birthday','date']
        ];
    }
}</pre>
2. add an action
<pre>public function actionTest(){
        $test=new Test();
        $test->birthday="20121212";
        $test->validate();
        return $test->hasErrors();
    }
</pre>

3.go http://localhost/index.php?r=site%2Ftest  
you will see exception.

